-- Smash history: the sets of 2013-2014 Project M majors (filed under P+), read by hand from Liquipedia's bracket
-- pages (round 734's way; Matthew, 2026-11-22: "Continue"). Liquipedia keeps the later rounds of most of these
-- brackets, not every set; scores as it lists them; undecided and forfeited sets left out. Made with
-- tools/liquipedia/bracket-to-sql.mjs from tools/liquipedia/brackets/2013-2014-pplus.txt. Safe to run twice.

-- manual/2014-the-big-house-4 (pplus): 61 sets, from https://liquipedia.net/smash/The_Big_House/4/Project_M/Singles_Bracket
on conflict (set_id) do update set round = excluded.round, sort_order = excluded.sort_order, p1_name = excluded.p1_name,
  p1_score = excluded.p1_score, p2_name = excluded.p2_name, p2_score = excluded.p2_score, winner = excluded.winner;

